; INVALID: an authored name in the chain's generated `<name>__…` space.
;
; The lowering names its views/passes `<name>__…` deterministically. A document
; that already declares one of those names would intern the synthetic resource
; to the same id and silently replace the author's form, so the hook refuses
; at the authored form.

(texture :name fillMips__view1 :size [64 64] :format rgba8unorm
  :mip-level-count 4 :usage [texture-binding render-attachment])
(mip-chain :name fillMips :texture fillMips__view1)
